provider: brevo (Brevo)

## minimal config
{
  "api_key": "xkeysib-",
  "from": "alerts@example.com",
  "to": "ops@example.com"
}

### down
POST https://api.brevo.com/v3/smtp/email
api-key: xkeysib-
(json)
{
  "sender": {
    "email": "alerts@example.com",
    "name": "Vigilant Vole"
  },
  "subject": "🔴 Payments API is down",
  "textContent": "Payments API is down\nHTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7",
  "to": [
    {
      "email": "ops@example.com"
    }
  ]
}

### up
POST https://api.brevo.com/v3/smtp/email
api-key: xkeysib-
(json)
{
  "sender": {
    "email": "alerts@example.com",
    "name": "Vigilant Vole"
  },
  "subject": "🟢 Payments API is back up",
  "textContent": "Payments API is back up\ndown for 12m 4s\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nDowntime: 12m 4s\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7",
  "to": [
